      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "EXCELLENT OPPORTUNITY FOR FIRST-TIME BUYERS, DOWN-SIZERS & INVESTORS\r\n \r\nTony Donnelly and Leonard Wilson Keenan are delighted to present this charming two-bedroom detached cottage to the market. Set on a generous and highly desirable c. 0.35-acre site, this property beautifully combines traditional charm with modern convenience, featuring a bright kitchen extension to the rear. One of its standout features is the exceptionally private, mature garden and secure off-street parking, accessed via private electric gates.\r\n\r\nSuperb Location\r\nIdeally situated on the Dublin Road, the property boasts an enviable location directly opposite the Athy Primary Care Centre, the local Rugby Club, and the GAA club. Residents will enjoy ultimate convenience, with Athy town centre, the train station (perfect for commuters), the local swimming pool, primary and secondary schools, and all essential local amenities within comfortable walking distance.\r\n \r\nAccommodation\r\nThe deceptively spacious accommodation is well-laid out and comprises:\r\n•\tEntrance Hall: A welcoming entry point to the home.\r\n•\tSitting Room: A cosy yet airy living space featuring a striking raised ceiling and a solid fuel stove.\r\n•\tKitchen / Dining Area: Located in the rear extension, offering a bright and functional space for cooking.\r\n•\tBedrooms: Two well-proportioned double bedrooms.\r\n•\tShower Room: A fully equipped, practical family shower room.\r\n•\tAttic: A spacious attic providing ample storage.\r\n \r\nServices & Features\r\n•\tSite Size: Generous 0.35-acre plot with private, mature gardens including two garden sheds\r\n•\tSecurity: Fully Alarmed with Secure parking and electric gate access.\r\n•\tHeating: Dual heating system (Oil-fired central heating & solid fuel stove).\r\n•\tUtilities: Mains water and mains sewage.\r\n \r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the space, privacy, and potential this wonderful cottage has to offer.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
